  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Significant rule says that reading should has same significant figure as that of reading given.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5375</mn><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> rounded to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>0.07395<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo></math>&nbsp;rounded to<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo></math>0.07</p><p>therefore,&nbsp;<sub><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>54</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>07</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></math></sub></p>",
    "image": null
  },
